### AgriChain API examples
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or the JetBrains HTTP client.
### Run the login requests first: their tokens are reused below.

@base = http://localhost:5000
@password = AgriChain@123

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Regions (for the register form)
GET {{base}}/api/regions

### Register
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Farmer",
  "phone": "9123456780",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "role": "FARMER",
  "region_id": 1,
  "base_location": "Erumely"
}

### Login as farmer
# @name farmerLogin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9991110001", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login as buyer
# @name buyerLogin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9791118801", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login as warehouse owner
# @name ownerLogin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9771238800", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login as delivery partner
# @name partnerLogin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9000011111", "password": "{{password}}" }

@farmer = {{farmerLogin.response.body.token}}
@buyer = {{buyerLogin.response.body.token}}
@owner = {{ownerLogin.response.body.token}}
@partner = {{partnerLogin.response.body.token}}

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Produce catalogue
GET {{base}}/api/produce

### Today's market price for produce 1
GET {{base}}/api/produce/1/price

### Farmer: create a listing (priced at today's market rate)
POST {{base}}/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "produce_id": 1, "available_qty": 40 }

### Farmer: create a listing at their own price (must be within ±20% of market)
POST {{base}}/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "produce_id": 2, "available_qty": 60, "listing_price": 40 }

### Farmer: my listings
GET {{base}}/api/listings/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Farmer: update quantity and/or price
PATCH {{base}}/api/listings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "available_qty": 25, "listing_price": 30 }

### Farmer: stop selling listing 1, then sell it again
PATCH {{base}}/api/listings/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

###
PATCH {{base}}/api/listings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "is_active": true }

### Farmer: delete listing 1 (refused while it has open orders)
DELETE {{base}}/api/listings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Buyer: browse listings in my region
GET {{base}}/api/listings?region_id=1&category=VEGETABLE

### Any user: swap my token for a fresh 1-hour one (refused 12 hours after the original login)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}

### Buyer: add to my cart (adding the same listing again adds up the quantity)
POST {{base}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "listing_id": 1, "quantity": 3 }

### Buyer: my cart, grouped by farmer with live prices and delivery fees
GET {{base}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}

### Buyer: change a cart item's quantity
PATCH {{base}}/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 4 }

### Buyer: remove a cart item
DELETE {{base}}/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}

### Buyer: empty the cart
DELETE {{base}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}

### Buyer: check out the cart (one order per farmer, returns the new orders)
POST {{base}}/api/cart/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "delivery_address": "Shop 4, Erumely Market Road" }

### Buyer: order items directly, without the cart (also one order per farmer)
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "listing_id": 1, "quantity": 3 }], "delivery_address": "Shop 4, Erumely Market Road" }

### Buyer: my orders
GET {{base}}/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}

### Farmer: incoming pending orders
GET {{base}}/api/orders/incoming?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Farmer: confirm order 1
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Partner: confirmed orders waiting for pickup in my region
GET {{base}}/api/deliveries/available
Authorization: Bearer {{partner}}

### Partner: pick up order 1
PATCH {{base}}/api/deliveries/1/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{partner}}

### Partner: mark order 1 delivered
PATCH {{base}}/api/deliveries/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{partner}}

### Partner: report order 1 is running late (reason: TRAFFIC, VEHICLE, WEATHER, WAITING_AT_FARM, OTHER; minutes 5–240)
PATCH {{base}}/api/deliveries/1/delay
Authorization: Bearer {{partner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "TRAFFIC", "minutes": 30 }

### Partner: give order 1 back so another partner can take it
PATCH {{base}}/api/deliveries/1/release
Authorization: Bearer {{partner}}

### Partner: my deliveries
GET {{base}}/api/deliveries/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{partner}}

### Buyer: review a delivered order
POST {{base}}/api/orders/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5, "comment": "Very fresh, delivered on time" }

### Public: a farmer's reviews
GET {{base}}/api/reviews?farmer_id=1

### Buyer: rate the delivery partner of a delivered order
POST {{base}}/api/orders/1/partner-review
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 4, "comment": "Arrived on time" }

### Public: a delivery partner's / warehouse's reviews
GET {{base}}/api/reviews/partners?partner_id=1

###
GET {{base}}/api/reviews/warehouses?warehouse_id=1

### Farmer: rate a warehouse after taking produce out
POST {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5, "comment": "Clean and well kept" }

### Farmer: add my own produce type (no market price)
POST {{base}}/api/produce
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Drumstick leaves", "category": "VEGETABLE" }

### Account: change name and place
PATCH {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Demo Farmer", "base_location": "Erumely" }

### Account: change password (returns a fresh login)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "current_password": "{{password}}", "new_password": "NewPassword@123" }

### Forgot password: ask for a code (printed in the server console; dev_code in the answer when RESET_CODE_IN_RESPONSE is on)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9991110001" }

### Forgot password: use the code
POST {{base}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "9991110001", "code": "123456", "new_password": "{{password}}" }

### Notifications: mine, then mark read
GET {{base}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Dashboards (stats depend on the role in the token)
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{partner}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}

### Buyer: cancel a pending order
PATCH {{base}}/api/orders/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{buyer}}

### Owner: create a warehouse (a multipart form: the fields plus 2 to 5 photos, JPEG/PNG/WebP up to 5 MB each)
POST {{base}}/api/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WarehouseBoundary

--WarehouseBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Erumely Dry Warehouse
--WarehouseBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="location"

Town Road
--WarehouseBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="total_capacity_kg"

2000
--WarehouseBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price_per_kg_per_day"

0.10
--WarehouseBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="is_cold_storage"

false
--WarehouseBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="inside.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./inside.jpg
--WarehouseBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photos"; filename="entrance.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./entrance.jpg
--WarehouseBoundary--

### Owner: change a warehouse (price only affects new requests; pausing needs no open bookings)
PATCH {{base}}/api/warehouses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price_per_kg_per_day": 0.12, "total_capacity_kg": 1500 }

### Owner: remove a warehouse (refused while it has waiting or approved bookings)
DELETE {{base}}/api/warehouses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}

### Owner: remove photo 1 of warehouse 1 (a warehouse always keeps at least 2)
DELETE {{base}}/api/warehouses/1/photos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}

### Browse cold storage in region 1
GET {{base}}/api/warehouses?region_id=1&cold_storage=true

### Farmer: how much space is free on every day of 1-15 Nov
GET {{base}}/api/warehouses/1/availability?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-15
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Farmer: ask for space (the owner has to accept; days are counted inclusively)
POST {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "warehouse_id": 1, "produce_id": 1, "quantity_kg": 100, "start_date": "2026-11-01", "end_date": "2026-11-15" }

### Farmer: my bookings
GET {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Owner: bookings at my warehouses
GET {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/incoming
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}

### Owner: accept booking 1
PATCH {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}

### Owner: decline booking 1 with a reason
PATCH {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "No room for onions that week" }

### Farmer: cancel a waiting request (or an approved booking that has not started)
PATCH {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Farmer: take the produce out (pays for the days used; overdue days count)
PATCH {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/1/release
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}

### Farmer: ask to keep it longer
POST {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/1/extend
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "new_end_date": "2026-11-30" }

### Owner: accept or decline the extension
PATCH {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/1/extension/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}

###
PATCH {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/1/extension/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{owner}}

### Farmer: withdraw the extension request
PATCH {{base}}/api/warehouse-bookings/1/extension/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{farmer}}
